- Yeah, thrown, yeah, because
they almost did that to me.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.523
- How many?
- They almost did that to me.

00:13:36.523 --> 00:13:39.320
They tried, but I wasn't going down.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.270
- [Mark] So when you lived there,

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.703
how many times did you see that happening?

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:47.953
- Well to be honest, the baby
and I found a dead body once.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.790
But I'm not...

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.610
Hearing about it, more than once.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:58.243
Seeing it and witnessing it, not at all.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.510
I haven't seen or witnessed it.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:03.470
I was gonna be one because I
almost jumped out the window

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:06.203
myself when the baby
got kidnapped from me.

00:14:08.231 --> 00:14:10.040
I literally almost jumped out the window

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.450
and my friend caught me by my ankle

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.920
and I busted my chin on a
thing, I got a scar right here.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.110
But yeah, I literally tried
to jump out the window

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.060
when that happened.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:21.783
I didn't want to live.

00:14:21.783 --> 00:14:23.450
I thought my baby was gone,

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.170
so who wants to live without
their child, you know?

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.920
Even though I didn't have
him, I felt, you know,

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.410
I felt everything that an
actual mother would feel

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.550
if they gave birth to their
child, you know what I mean?

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.510
Me and my brother were so close,

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.260
me and the baby were so close,

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.930
he was my kid, he was my son, you know?

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.193
He called me sissy mommy, you know?

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:43.720
He knew who his mother was, though.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:44.960
He knew our mother was our mother,

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.640
and he knew I was his sister,

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:50.540
but he called me sissy mommy
because I was like his mommy.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.100
I did everything for him.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.810
I gave him his first birthday, everything.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:59.240
I even dressed up like a damn
clown for his birthday, okay?

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.940
- Do you still talk to him?
- No.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.323
He's in prison for murder.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.270
Mark my words, I said, if
he lives with his father,

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.380
he's gonna either end up dead or in prison

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.947
by the time he's 18, sure enough.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.643
His 17th birthday,

00:15:20.643 --> 00:15:24.143
he stabbed his girlfriend
17 times to death.

